<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Piper starts Fine Host.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Piper starts Fine Host.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it initiated coverage Fine Host Corp with a strong buy rating and a 12-month price target of $27 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/4 to 21-3/8.</p>
</text>
